        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Reima Juhani Karppinen, Pertti Karppinen\n- Sports: rowing, double sculls\n- Events: 1981 World Rowing Championships\n- Places: Oberschleißheim, Munich, Germany\n\nFacts:\n- Reima Juhani Karppinen was born on 27 January 1958 and is a retired Finnish rower.\n- Reima Juhani Karppinen specialized in the double sculls event in rowing.\n- The 1981 World Rowing Championships were held from 30 August to 6 September 1981 at Oberschleißheim outside Munich, Germany.\n- Reima Juhani Karppinen won a silver medal in the double sculls at the 1981 World Rowing Championships with his brother Pertti Karppinen.",
